  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d6bd2defdcfc560478dded90001869da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::WorldTextPanel
  text: '<align=left><color=#FFD24A><b>THE GAME</b></color>

    <size=72%>The hub is play money. Open the menu (Y):

    <b>FRIENDS</b>  host or join a lobby

    <b>RUN</b>  start the game


    You owe the family. Every day has a <b>quota</b> and a <b>clock</b>. Have the quota in cash when time runs out and the collector takes his cut - then a bigger quota tomorrow.


    <color=#FF6A5C><b>Come up short and everyone gets shot.</b></color>


